    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Integrating,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;to solve RHS&nbsp;2nd integration,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p>"
